[ti:Sign2Song Demo]
[ar:Built-in demo]
[00:00.00]Raise an open palm to begin
[00:04.00]Hold it steady for half a second
[00:08.00]The music follows your hand
[00:12.00]Now show a peace sign
[00:16.00]Keep it up, the beat flows on
[00:20.00]Lose the pose and the song will wait
[00:24.00]Make a fist, hold it tight
[00:28.00]Lyrics pause when the music stops
[00:32.00]Match again to carry on
[00:36.00]Last pose: the rock sign
[00:40.00]Index and pinky to the sky
[00:44.00]That's the end of the demo
